  "body": "OPEN HOME THIS WEEKEND - SAT / SUN 2.00PM | VENDOR MOTIVATED - MUST BE SOLD!\r\n\r\nThe wait is over! Now fully completed and ready for its new owners, this impressive brand-new home presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality residence in one of Millwater's final and most sought-after neighbourhoods. With a motivated vendor ready to move on, buyers are encouraged to take advantage of this opportunity and make their interest known.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with space, flexibility and modern family living in mind, this exceptional home offers a versatile layout ideal for growing families, multi-generational living or those simply wanting room to spread out.\r\n\r\nYou'll love:\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining\r\n* A stylish designer kitchen featuring quality appliances, generous bench space and contemporary finishes\r\n* Five spacious bedrooms, including a private master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* A separate wing featuring two bedrooms, a bathroom and additional living area - ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers or working from home\r\n* Two separate outdoor entertaining areas, perfect for summer BBQs and family gatherings\r\n* Beautifully appointed bathrooms with modern fixtures and fittings\r\n* Ducted air conditioning throughout for year-round comfort\r\n* Low-maintenance landscaping for easy living\r\n* Internal access garaging and excellent storage throughout\r\n* Brand-new construction, now fully finished and ready for immediate enjoyment\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Millwater's final stages, you'll enjoy easy access to quality schools, parks, walkways, shopping, cafés and motorway connections, all within this popular and established community.\r\n\r\nWith no building delays or waiting for completion, you can secure a brand-new home and move straight into the lifestyle you've been looking for.\r\n\r\nOur first open home for the completed home is this weekend at Sat / Sun 2.00pm - make sure you come along!\r\n\r\nContact Sarah today by phone or text on 021 919 459 for further information or to arrange a private viewing. The vendor is ready to consider offers, so don't miss your opportunity!",
